OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder after
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Ffollowing a fatal stabbing in the Small
OL,8,FHeath area of Birmingham.
OL,10,FSaeed Ismail, aged 46 from Birmingham,
OL,11,Fis accused of the murder of Abdillahi
OL,12,FFarid Ali. He is due to appear before
OL,13,FBirmingham Magistrates' Court later.
OL,15,FWest Midlands Police said they
OL,16,Funderstood the killing, which took
OL,17,Fplace at about 13:15 GMT on Wednesday
OL,18,Fin Whitmore Road at the junction of
OL,19,FCoventry Road, had worried the
OL,20,Fcommunity and extra officers would be
OL,21,Fin the area to provide reassurance.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
